cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Stripe Sigma Schema Reference
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it. Contributions of verified columns
  are more valuable than citations.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable reference for the Stripe Sigma SQL data warehouse
  schema: 262 tables and 4,168 columns with types, primary and foreign keys, enum
  values, data-freshness SLAs, Trino dialect notes and query pitfalls. Each
  column carries a confidence level. Includes referentially
  valid synthetic sample data, a runnable SQLite sandbox, and an MCP server.
  Designed as a context source for AI agents writing Stripe Sigma SQL.
  Coverage is not guaranteed complete or current.
  Unofficial and not affiliated with Stripe, Inc.
authors:
  - name: stripe-sigma-schema contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/clayhere/stripe_sigma_schema"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-28"
license: CC0-1.0
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"
keywords:
  - Stripe Sigma
  - Stripe Sigma schema
  - Stripe data schema
  - Stripe Data Pipeline
  - SQL schema
  - Trino
  - payments analytics
  - text-to-SQL
  - LLM context
  - AI agent reference
  - Model Context Protocol
